    "en": "Find a few smooth pebbles. Hold one and say one feeling out loud. Put it down. Feel lighter?"
   }
  },
  {
   "title": {
    "en": "Stepping stones"
   },
   "text": {
    "en": "Make a path with cushions or paper 'stones'. Say one thing you feel on each step."
   }
  },
  {
   "title": {
    "en": "Hare hop"
   },
   "text": {
    "en": "How far can you jump? A hare can leap about 3 metres!"
   }
  },
  {
   "title": {
    "en": "Frog song"
   },
   "text": {
    "en": "Puff your cheeks like a frog's balloons and croak 're-re-re-re' as fast as you can."
   }
  },
  {
   "title": {
    "en": "Find France"
   },
   "text": {
    "en": "Find France on a map, then look for the middle of the country. That's where the Brenne is."
   }
  }
